# Always restart the app

After any gameplay, UI, asset, or script change that should be visible in-game:

1. Run `powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools/restart_app.ps1` from the project root before ending your turn.
2. Do this even when tests already passed — the user verifies changes in the running game.
3. Skip restart only for docs-only or question-only replies with zero code/asset edits.

Default launch is the normal bootstrap scene. Use `-Pjotr` or `-Classic` only when the change is mode-specific.
